{"title":"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the center of the circle passing through the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/c/9cc97d11165519987d52074b4f215a0f9837b9b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and tangent to the circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b02ae718756895bc1924d5290f0abd320bfa77ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />? (Two circles are tangent at a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> if they intersect at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and at no other point.)\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/b/00bc059af7b25de3ab7957a6c887569ef06b1fdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }(0,-6) \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } (1,-9) \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } (-1,-9) \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } (0,-9) \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\rm{none \\ } \\rm{of \\ } \\rm{these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"634\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the circle we are looking for be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/653ed6b0d22b004638ae4d55f00c549a7c0dadd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-h)^{2}+(y-k)^{2}=r^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"19\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169720b6d97c7c69f8f8a740ff74dee5dbc96419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(h,k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" /> is the center. Plugging in points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/c/9cc97d11165519987d52074b4f215a0f9837b9b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> gives us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/9436c00172e7f348436060e7cd17cec9159d62c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k-h=8$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />. Seeing our answer choices, none of the points work, thus our answer is E.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_24\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 24\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_26\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 26\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018113217\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 50/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2085/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3437:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018113217 and revision id 76053. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}